    "limits": {
      "type": "centre-note",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "blue",
        "max_width": 46,
        "eyebrow": "What it will not do",
        "heading": "Where the geometry still wins.",
        "body": "<p>Water above the cuff gets in, and once it is in, the sock holds it about as well as it kept it out. On a commute that means kerbside puddles rather than a flooded lane.</p>",
        "footnote": "<p>Every limit we know about is published, not only this one. <a href=\"/#limits\">Read the rest</a>.</p>"
