    "faq": {
      "type": "faq-accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are these actually waterproof, or just water resistant?",
            "answer": "<p>Waterproof. The middle layer is a Porelle\u00ae membrane \u2014 a licensed third-party laminate, not a name we invented \u2014 sealed inside a three-layer knit. Water that goes in over the top of the cuff is inside the sock, and no waterproof sock behaves otherwise.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will my feet still sweat?",
            "answer": "<p>If you work hard enough, yes. The membrane moves vapour out, which delays the point at which the foot is wet from the inside. It does not repeal it. Breathable and dry are not the same word.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do they replace waterproof boots?",
            "answer": "<p>No. They are one component of a system. If your footwear is wrong for the ground you are on, a sock will not fix it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What size should I order?",
            "answer": "<p>Four bands: S covers UK 3-5, M covers UK 6-8, L covers UK 9-11, XL covers UK 12-14. The size guide opens over the buy widget without leaving the page, and it is measurement-led \u2014 shoe sizing is not consistent between brands.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much is delivery?",
            "answer": "<p>Free UK delivery on two pairs or more. On a single pair, delivery is charged at checkout and shown before you pay. No delivery speed is printed anywhere on this site, because we will not promise one that confirmed stock cannot support.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why are there no reviews on this site?",
            "answer": "<p>Because there are none yet. HydroSox is new, and a rating with nothing behind it is worth nothing. When there is real review volume it will be published here \u2014 including the reviews that do not flatter us.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
